    skos:definition "The negation within gmeow:RestrictionCoherenceConstraint (G2, sharpens-refinement coherence): holds only when it is NOT the case that ∃?g. ?g is a gmeow:DisagreementObstruction."@x-gmeow-english ; logic:not gmeow:rccObstrEx .
gmeow:rccObstrEx a logic:Formula ;
